# Keep line endings as LF in the repository on every computer (Windows included): SQL migrations, shell and Node scripts
# and _headers must not be converted to CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Windows batch launchers must keep CRLF, or cmd.exe can mis-handle labels and GOTO after a clone from GitHub (21 Nov 2026)
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
